{"quest_id": 4296, "name": "生命の木", "description": "強力な物理攻撃に注意し\n魔物たちを迎え撃て！\n＜敵の物理攻撃がアップ＞\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "modifier_notes": ["敵の物理攻撃がアップ"], "event": "魔王の迷宮", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920043, "map_no": 3569, "level": 90, "multiplier": 0.9, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 18, "params": [170]}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4500, "attack": 360, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 1, "hp": 576, "attack": 126, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 8}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 14, "form_count": 1, "hp": 468, "attack": 9, "base_hp": 520, "base_attack": 10, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 7, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2099152, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 165, "global_id": 164, "spawn_sec": 51}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4500, "attack": 540, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097808, "master_id": 43, "global_id": 42, "spawn_sec": 75}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 190, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1350, "attack": 284, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 316, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097488, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 20015, "global_id": 1090, "spawn_sec": 109}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 140, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2700, "attack": 331, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 368, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 172, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097504, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 20016, "global_id": 1091, "spawn_sec": 111}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 2, "level": 140, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1800, "attack": 102, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 113, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097536, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 20017, "global_id": 1092, "spawn_sec": 118}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "あそこにあるのはもしや「生命の木」でしょうか？\n「生命の木」は周囲の味方ユニットを\n回復することができる効力があると聞きます。", "face": "l81910d30b191"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あ、先客の方がおられるようですね。\nこの迷宮内を一人で探索しているなんて……。", "face": "l81910d30b191"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "あら？　あなたたちも冒険者？\nアタシは魔法剣士のシャルロット。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "自分の腕試しのためにパーティーを組んで\nこのダンジョンを探索していたところですわ。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "パーティーの仲間たちとはぐれてしまったので\nちょうどここにある生命の木を見つけて\n一休みしていたところですわ。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "……さて、体力も回復したことですし、\nパーティーと合流しないといけませんから、\nアタシはこれで行きますわ。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "私たちも少し休憩いたしましょうか王子。"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "敵襲！　敵襲！\n戦闘の準備を！", "face": "l19c8bba64df9"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "どうやらゆっくり休んでいるわけには\nいかないようですね。", "face": "l81910d30b191"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 112, "lines": [{"name": "冒険者", "text": "おい、あいつら魔物と戦ってるぜ。", "face": "l2318e74fc12b"}, {"name": "冒険者", "text": "まさか……、あいつら生命の木を独り占めしよう\nってんじゃ……！　そうはさせるか！", "face": "l2318e74fc12b"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あれは……。\n冒険者の方々！　ここは危ないですから\n下がってください！", "face": "l81910d30b191"}, {"name": "冒険者", "text": "うるせぇ！　独り占めしようったって\nそうはいかねぇ！\n生命の木は俺たちのものだ！", "face": "l2318e74fc12b"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "終わりましたか……。\n冒険者の人たちはどこかへ行ってしまわれたようです。\n行方が気になりますが、ここは先に進みましょう。", "face": "l81910d30b191"}]}], "active": true}